# PWA build output (regenerated by `bun run build` on every build).
#
# Scoped to the exact GENERATED naming schemes, never to a whole directory: the
# fingerprinted icons and public/icons/icons.gen.json are manually generated,
# committed provenance (`bun run gen:icons`) and must stay tracked. A successful
# build therefore leaves `git status` clean, which is what lets the next build's
# clean-source guard pass.
# NB: git has no trailing-comment syntax — a `# …` after a pattern is part of
# the pattern and silently matches nothing. Comments stay on their own lines.
#
# The patterns below spell the release ID out as twelve [0-9a-f] classes because
# git globs cannot express a hex range — `*` would also swallow
# `manifest-studio-light.preview.json` or a hand-authored `offline.draft.html`,
# and an invisible file can be copied into a build without review. Family and
# mode are enumerated rather than globbed so the ignore rules mirror
# GENERATED_PUBLIC_RE in scripts/release.ts exactly; a test asserts the two stay
# in lockstep, so adding a theme family fails loudly here instead of leaking an
# untracked generated file.
#
# gen-pwa output (release-suffixed manifest variants)
public/manifest-studio-light.[0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f].json
public/manifest-studio-dark.[0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f].json
public/manifest-mission-light.[0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f].json
public/manifest-mission-dark.[0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f].json
public/manifest-neo-light.[0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f].json
public/manifest-neo-dark.[0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f].json
public/manifest-ember-light.[0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f].json
